 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? That's a long shot. Most people stay one to three nights these days. Do you want to stay near the airport or near the city? Sure thing. So, an overnight or a few days? That's nice of you. Okay. The sofa is heavy as heck, though. Whether it's one night or several, it comes down to what's convenient for you and your family. Staying over one night helps her keep her routine. Renting it for a few nights gives you a real break if you do several errands.",
